{"channelId":"UCphmOpdzeoq8lgnX0x55rCg","row":["BestPals Animal Rescue Center",14,"Hi there!  We are BestPals Animal Rescue Center, a no-kill non-profit animal rescue located in Holland, Michigan.  We have been in operation for 10 years now, and are primarily volunteer-run thanks to our amazing community.\n\nWe help the animals others cannot by focusing on owner-surrenders and shelter-transfers.  Our mission is to ensure our furry-friends find their best #FureverHome, with the help and care of our patient volunteers , and our foster-to-adopt program, where potential owners are able to spend a couple weeks with the dog or cat to make sure it's a positive experience for everyone in the home.\n\nWe're slowly looking to expand our presence on social media, and wanted to say hello, and thank you for your support!\n\n#BestPalsAnimalRescueCenter #MeetYourNewBestPal","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCphmOpdzeoq8lgnX0x55rCg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCphmOpdzeoq8lgnX0x55rCg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:42.504Z","channelId":"UCphmOpdzeoq8lgnX0x55rCg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"62fec0150addffd75e9b08578ded81a815179bbfd985e0a038235520a2524542","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"7f318e5a36d9991985304313fe040cf6910c2907925c703adbdb20c336588a0b"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCphmOpdzeoq8lgnX0x55rCg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:42.504Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCphmOpdzeoq8lgnX0x55rCg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":14,"raw":"14 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCphmOpdzeoq8lgnX0x55rCg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:42.504Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["animal rescue"],"relevantKeywords":["animal rescue"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile",